.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK WORK COMMENT EDIT"
.SH NAME
hamstik work comment edit \- Edit your own comment
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik work comment edit [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Edit your own comment
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I KEY
Work item key
.TP
.I COMMENT_ID
Comment id (UUID)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --body
Replacement body
.TP
.B --body-file
Replacement body source (path, or - for stdin)
.TP
.B --body-editor
Author the body in $VISUAL/$EDITOR instead of passing text
Choices: true, false
.TP
.B --idempotency-key
Explicit idempotency key
